# Native Options navigation, live rendering/FPS changes and a 640/800/4K cycle
# through the single resolution selector in the original Graphics tab.
# Use an isolated profile, the shipped core.display and texture pack, and
# RECOMP_DDRAW_MODES=640x480x8,640x480x16,800x600x16,3840x2160x16.
# The final unit-selection/movement assertions prove the game resumed.
await picture>0.98 for 2000 within 60000
key F10 down
wait 200
key F10 up
wait 2000
dumpc frontend
peek 0x749cd8 4
peek 0x5d7374 4
